<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 2cm 2.5cm; }
  body { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.5; }

  .cover { page-break-after: always; padding-top: 4cm; }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 28pt; color: #1a1a2e; margin-bottom: 0.3cm; }
  .cover .subtitle { font-size: 13pt; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 2cm; }
  .cover .meta-table td { padding: 0.2cm 0.5cm; font-size: 10pt; }
  .cover .meta-table td:first-child { font-weight: bold; color: #374151; width: 5cm; }

  .logo-bar { border-top: 4px solid #4f46e5; padding-top: 0.3cm; margin-bottom: 1.5cm; }
  .logo-bar span { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; color: #4f46e5; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  h2 { font-size: 16pt; color: #1a1a2e; border-bottom: 2px solid #4f46e5; padding-bottom: 0.15cm; margin-top: 1cm; }
  h3 { font-size: 12pt; color: #374151; margin-top: 0.7cm; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0.5cm 0; font-size: 9pt; }
  thead th { background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 0.2cm 0.3cm; text-align: left; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f3f4f6; }
  td, th { padding: 0.15cm 0.3cm; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }

  .figure { text-align: center; margin: 0.5cm 0; }
  .figure img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 12cm; }
  .figure-caption { font-size: 8pt; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 0.2cm; font-style: italic; }

  .page-break { page-break-before: always; }

  .summary-box {
    background: #eff6ff;
    border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
    padding: 0.4cm 0.7cm;
    margin: 0.5cm 0;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .stat-row td { border: none; padding: 0.1cm 0.3cm; }
  .stat-label { font-weight: bold; color: #374151; }
  .stat-up { color: #D73027; font-weight: bold; }
  .stat-down { color: #4575B4; font-weight: bold; }

  p { margin: 0.3cm 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══ COVER ══ -->
<div class="cover">
  <div class="logo-bar"><span>GENOLENS V2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; SCILICIUM</span></div>
  <h1>{{ project.name }}</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Transcriptomics Analysis Report</div>
  <table class="meta-table" style="width:auto; border:none;">
    <tr><td>Date</td><td>{{ generated_at }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Reference</td><td>{{ reference_number }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Project ID</td><td>{{ project.id }}</td></tr>
    {% if project.description %}<tr><td>Description</td><td>{{ project.description }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
    <tr><td>Species</td><td>{{ project.species or 'N/A' }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Comparisons</td><td>{{ comparisons|length }}</td></tr>
  </table>
</div>

<!-- ══ EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ══ -->
<h2>Executive Summary</h2>
<div class="summary-box">
  This report summarises the differential expression analysis performed on project
  <strong>{{ project.name }}</strong> (ref. {{ reference_number }}).
  {% if comparisons|length == 1 %}
  One comparison was analysed.
  {% else %}
  {{ comparisons|length }} comparisons were analysed.
  {% endif %}
  The report covers sample quality metrics, principal component analysis, differential expression results, and pathway enrichment.
</div>

<!-- ══ MATERIAL & METHODS ══ -->
<h2>Material &amp; Methods</h2>
<h3>Library preparation and sequencing</h3>
<p>RNA-seq libraries were prepared and sequenced on an Illumina platform. Read quality was assessed with FastQC.</p>
<h3>Bioinformatic processing</h3>
<p>Reads were aligned against the reference genome using STAR. Gene-level read counts were generated with featureCounts and normalised using DESeq2 variance-stabilising transformation (VST) for exploratory analyses.</p>
<h3>Differential expression analysis</h3>
<p>Differential expression was assessed using DESeq2. Genes with adjusted p-value (Benjamini-Hochberg) &lt; 0.05 and |log₂(Fold Change)| &gt; 1 were considered significantly differentially expressed (DEGs).</p>
<h3>Pathway enrichment analysis</h3>
<p>Over-representation analysis (ORA) was performed against Gene Ontology (GO-BP, MF, CC), KEGG, and Reactome databases using clusterProfiler. Results were filtered at padj &lt; 0.05.</p>

<!-- ══ SAMPLE QC ══ -->
{% if qc_data %}
<h2 class="page-break">Sample Quality Control</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Sample</th>
      <th>Total Reads</th>
      <th>Mapped Reads</th>
      <th>Mapping Rate (%)</th>
      <th>Detected Genes</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for row in qc_data %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ row.sample }}</td>
    <td>{{ row.total_reads }}</td>
    <td>{{ row.mapped_reads }}</td>
    <td>{{ row.mapping_rate }}</td>
    <td>{{ row.detected_genes }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}

<!-- ══ PCA ══ -->
{% if pca_plot_b64 %}
<h2{% if not qc_data %} class="page-break"{% endif %}>Principal Component Analysis</h2>
<div class="figure">
  <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ pca_plot_b64 }}" alt="PCA plot">
  <div class="figure-caption">Figure 1 — PCA of VST-normalised expression across all samples. Each point represents one sample; colours indicate biological groups.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<!-- ══ PER-COMPARISON RESULTS ══ -->
{% for comp in comparisons %}
<div class="page-break">
<h2>Results — {{ comp.name }}</h2>

<div class="summary-box">
  <strong>DEG summary</strong> (padj &lt; 0.05, |log₂FC| &gt; 1):<br>
  <span class="stat-up">▲ {{ comp.deg_up }} up-regulated</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <span class="stat-down">▼ {{ comp.deg_down }} down-regulated</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;
  {{ comp.deg_total }} total genes tested
</div>

{% if comp.volcano_b64 %}
<h3>Volcano Plot</h3>
<div class="figure">
  <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ comp.volcano_b64 }}" alt="Volcano plot {{ comp.name }}">
  <div class="figure-caption">Volcano plot — {{ comp.name }}. Red: up-regulated DEGs; Blue: down-regulated DEGs; Grey: non-significant.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h3>Top Differentially Expressed Genes</h3>
{% if comp.top_up_genes or comp.top_down_genes %}
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Gene ID</th><th>Gene Name</th><th>log₂FC</th><th>adj. p-value</th><th>Direction</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for g in comp.top_up_genes %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ g.gene_id }}</td>
    <td>{{ g.gene_name or '' }}</td>
    <td style="color:#D73027">+{{ "%.3f"|format(g.log_fc) }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2e"|format(g.padj) }}</td>
    <td style="color:#D73027">Up</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  {% for g in comp.top_down_genes %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ g.gene_id }}</td>
    <td>{{ g.gene_name or '' }}</td>
    <td style="color:#4575B4">{{ "%.3f"|format(g.log_fc) }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2e"|format(g.padj) }}</td>
    <td style="color:#4575B4">Down</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<p><em>No significant DEGs found for this comparison.</em></p>
{% endif %}

{% if comp.dotplot_b64 %}
<h3>Pathway Enrichment</h3>
<div class="figure">
  <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ comp.dotplot_b64 }}" alt="Enrichment dotplot {{ comp.name }}">
  <div class="figure-caption">Top enriched pathways for {{ comp.name }}. Point size reflects gene count; colour indicates significance (-log₁₀ padj).</div>
</div>
{% if comp.enrichment_results %}
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Term</th><th>Database</th><th>adj. p-value</th><th>Gene Count</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for p in comp.enrichment_results[:30] %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ p.pathway_name }}</td>
    <td>{{ p.category or '' }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2e"|format(p.padj) }}</td>
    <td>{{ p.gene_count }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
</div>
{% endfor %}

<!-- ══ APPENDIX ══ -->
<div class="page-break">
<h2>Appendix — Full DEG Tables</h2>
{% for comp in comparisons %}
<h3>{{ comp.name }}</h3>
{% if comp.top_up_genes or comp.top_down_genes %}
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Gene ID</th><th>Gene Name</th><th>log₂FC</th><th>adj. p-value</th><th>Direction</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for g in comp.top_up_genes %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ g.gene_id }}</td>
    <td>{{ g.gene_name or '' }}</td>
    <td style="color:#D73027">+{{ "%.3f"|format(g.log_fc) }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2e"|format(g.padj) }}</td>
    <td>Up</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  {% for g in comp.top_down_genes %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ g.gene_id }}</td>
    <td>{{ g.gene_name or '' }}</td>
    <td style="color:#4575B4">{{ "%.3f"|format(g.log_fc) }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2e"|format(g.padj) }}</td>
    <td>Down</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<p><em>No significant DEGs for this comparison.</em></p>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</div>

</body>
</html>
